# POLLY, a section's fill: GROOVE runs A, A + fill, A no fill, B, B + fill, B no fill. Plain A into a B section fills
# (the groove changes); "A no fill" never does; "A + fill" always does. Two sections of P1 (4 bars; Pop, 105 BPM: a
# bar 2286 ms; the Intro 2 bars first), section 2 on B.
wait 300
tap HOME
tapkey w0
tapkey w0
expect rows 2
turn K1 -1
expect cursor 2
turn K3 3 200
expect row_sect2 2
expect knob3_is_B 1
turn K1 -1
expect cursor 1
turn K3 2 200
expect row_sect1 4
expect knob3_is_A_no_fill 1
turn K3 -2 200
turn K3 1 200
expect knob3_is_A_+_fill 1
turn K3 1 200
expect knob3_is_A_no_fill 1
wait 300
shot nofill_row.png
# ---- A no fill into B: section 1's last bar (about 12.5 s in, after the Intro) plays Groove A, then section 2 B
tap PLAY
wait 12500
expect row 1
expect sect 2
wait 2000
expect row 2
expect sect 3
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- plain A into B: the fill in section 1's last bar
turn K1 -5
expect cursor 1
turn K3 -2 200
expect row_sect1 0
tap PLAY
wait 12500
expect row 1
expect sect 4
tap PLAY
